<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>Link Not Found - thin.ly</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <style>
    body {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      color: #fff;
      text-align: center;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 3rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }

    .icon {
      font-size: 5rem;
      margin: 2rem 0;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3));
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin: 1rem 0;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .message {
      background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      margin: 2rem 0;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    }

    .message p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 0.5rem 0;
    }

    .reasons {
      background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      padding: 1rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .reasons strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .reasons ul {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .reasons li {
      margin: 0.5rem 0;
    }

    .footer {
      margin-top: 3rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      opacity: 0.8;
    }

    a {
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
      background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-top: 1rem;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .code {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
      font-size: 0.95em;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/systemu-net/thin.ly/refs/heads/develop/public/404.png" alt="404 - Page Not Found" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    
    <div class="message">
      <p>We couldn't find the short link you're looking for.</p>
      
      <div class="reasons">
        <strong>Possible reasons:</strong>
        <ul>
          <li>The link may have been deleted by its creator</li>
          <li>The link might have expired</li>
          <li>There may be a typo in the URL</li>
          <li>The link never existed</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <p>If you believe this link should exist, please contact the person who shared it with you.</p>
    </div>

    <a href="/" class="btn">Go to thin.ly Home</a>
    
    <div class="footer">
      <p>Want to create your own short links?</p>
      <p><a href="/">Sign up for <strong>thin.ly</strong></a> - Free and simple URL shortening</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
